
config TOUCHSCREEN_XIAOMI_TOUCHFEATURE
	bool "Xiaomi Touch Feature"
	depends on INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN
	help
	  Say Y here to enable the xiaomi touchfeature core: it provides the
	  /dev/xiaomi-touch misc device, the "touch" class that touchscreen
	  drivers hang their tp_dev child off, and the mode ioctl used by the
	  vendor userspace to toggle features such as double tap to wake.

	  This has to be built in rather than as a module: the touchscreen
	  drivers that call into it are boolean and are linked into vmlinux.

	  If unsure, say N.
